Why doesn’t Bitcoin just add smart contracts?

Its scripting is limited on purpose. That’s part of what keeps it simple and highly secure.

Ethereum Classic pairs the same proof-of-work security with a full virtual machine, the EVM.

Programmable Digital Gold.🍀